<!doctype lake><title>教案11-内存管理</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="MAo0p" id="MAo0p"><span data-lake-id="u032c6db7" id="u032c6db7">1.linux-C进程内存布局</span></h1><p data-lake-id="554a090ce92748a09e8167eb8e89bbfe" id="554a090ce92748a09e8167eb8e89bbfe" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u0f884969" id="u0f884969" class="lake-fontsize-12">任何一个程序，正常运行都需要内存资源，用来存放诸如变量、常量、函数代码等等。这些不同的内容，所存储的内存区域是不同的，且不同的区域有不同的特性。因此我们需要研究内存布局，逐个了解不同内存区域的特性。</span></p><p data-lake-id="a7e65e01ae5259b8bf46ddc4105311ea" id="a7e65e01ae5259b8bf46ddc4105311ea" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u7ff7d946" id="u7ff7d946" class="lake-fontsize-12">每个C语言进程都拥有一片结构相同的虚拟内存，例如三个完全不相干的进程p1、p2、p3，它们很显然会占据不同区段的物理内存，但经过系统的变换和映射，它们的虚拟内存的</span><span data-lake-id="ucf6cef17" id="ucf6cef17" class="lake-fontsize-12">布局</span><span data-lake-id="uf1902329" id="uf1902329" class="lake-fontsize-12">是完全一样的。</span></p><ul list="u48bb7347"><li fid="uc5f6146a" data-lake-id="u1e042198" id="u1e042198"><span data-lake-id="u01c59526" id="u01c59526" class="lake-fontsize-12">PM：Physical Memory，物理内存。</span></li><li fid="uc5f6146a" data-lake-id="ufe59fc96" id="ufe59fc96"><span data-lake-id="u2a3d2261" id="u2a3d2261" class="lake-fontsize-12">VM：Virtual Memory，虚拟内存。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="6fcf963c405124fb6e0a75fd8244ed29" id="6fcf963c405124fb6e0a75fd8244ed29" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560148944-735b96c3-2d1a-4607-a503-0ecf5f10e2b0.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A310%2C%22height%22%3A289%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A372%2C%22originHeight%22%3A347%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DUkzf%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="d0acddbb50b3c16a88016b47a2071e34" id="d0acddbb50b3c16a88016b47a2071e34" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u23bbaa13" id="u23bbaa13" class="lake-fontsize-12">虚拟内存VM和物理内存PM的关系</span></p><p data-lake-id="f1e92c21ed1ebed1f99835a6c46febd4" id="f1e92c21ed1ebed1f99835a6c46febd4"><span data-lake-id="u10d0e461" id="u10d0e461" class="lake-fontsize-12">将其中一个C语言进程的虚拟内存放大来看，会发现其内部包下区域：</span></p><ul list="ucc442a83"><li fid="u9dd9c003" data-lake-id="ucf61648e" id="ucf61648e"><span data-lake-id="udf4728eb" id="udf4728eb" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈（stack）</span></li><li fid="u9dd9c003" data-lake-id="ufe61566a" id="ufe61566a"><span data-lake-id="ua0bff8f0" id="ua0bff8f0" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆（heap）</span></li><li fid="u9dd9c003" data-lake-id="u049fe7ec" id="u049fe7ec"><span data-lake-id="u4fbfcc74" id="u4fbfcc74" class="lake-fontsize-12">数据段</span></li><li fid="u9dd9c003" data-lake-id="ua7ccc2ad" id="ua7ccc2ad"><span data-lake-id="uf74bf04a" id="uf74bf04a" class="lake-fontsize-12">代码段</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="b709164c23558c9779e5a3c0c71e515b" id="b709164c23558c9779e5a3c0c71e515b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560149102-a44822c9-e3ec-4a4b-820d-38c09c820a63.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A465%2C%22originHeight%22%3A366%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f2ed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DQgE3%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="1f447ccd5f06826640872f9e5034707f" id="1f447ccd5f06826640872f9e5034707f" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua417e300" id="ua417e300" class="lake-fontsize-12">32机虚拟内存典型布局</span></p><p data-lake-id="2d937ea7ab051a5ae52d6ab9b3dca33d" id="2d937ea7ab051a5ae52d6ab9b3dca33d"><span data-lake-id="udac96daa" id="udac96daa" class="lake-fontsize-12">虚拟内存中，内核区段对于应用程序而言是禁闭的，它们用于存放操作系统的关键性代码，另外由于 Linux 系统的历史性原因，在虚拟内存的最底端 0x0 ~ 0x08048000 之间也有一段禁闭的区段，该区段也是不可访问的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="58e327328387d168f17e936030a467c0" id="58e327328387d168f17e936030a467c0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560149373-49a2df30-543e-497e-a68d-154e55bc739d.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A551%2C%22height%22%3A398%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A916%2C%22originHeight%22%3A661%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f1e8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kQfgs%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="471368bb4be027519ceef76c599f00b1" id="471368bb4be027519ceef76c599f00b1"><span data-lake-id="u9e7b39a5" id="u9e7b39a5" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="q7VTI" id="q7VTI"><span data-lake-id="u6d1029d9" id="u6d1029d9">1.1 栈内存</span></h2><p data-lake-id="5b963296d01ea1b7eb11aa0a4d656db2" id="5b963296d01ea1b7eb11aa0a4d656db2" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u9baac00e" id="u9baac00e" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈，是现代计算机程序极为重要的组成部分，几乎所有的函数调用都依赖于栈进行实现。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u629c95ad" id="u629c95ad" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u1b68be65" id="u1b68be65" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈空间中包括：</span></p><ul list="ud30f3d67"><li fid="u9007b391" data-lake-id="u7a1afab6" id="u7a1afab6"><span data-lake-id="uf9421d2c" id="uf9421d2c" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数返回地址：记录了函数执行完成后，退出函数调用时需要执行的下一条指令</span></li><li fid="u9007b391" data-lake-id="u360d8699" id="u360d8699" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ua2253036" id="ua2253036" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">命令行参数 ./a.exe abc 123</span></li><li fid="u9007b391" data-lake-id="u5410f106" id="u5410f106"><span data-lake-id="u155ac59b" id="u155ac59b" class="lake-fontsize-12">局部变量：（包括形参）函数调用过程中使用的非静态局部变量均默认保存在栈上，函数退出后，这些变量也会被释放而不可使用</span></li><li fid="u9007b391" data-lake-id="ufaa36e3f" id="ufaa36e3f"><span data-lake-id="u4f9674cb" id="u4f9674cb" class="lake-fontsize-12">保存的寄存器（环境变量等）：保存了函数调用前后需要保持不变的寄存器</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udf9272c4" id="udf9272c4"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ca214de672400c6da02cf7767833d54a" id="ca214de672400c6da02cf7767833d54a" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u6c96c300" id="u6c96c300" class="lake-fontsize-12">在程序运行过程中，每次执行函数调用，都会建立一个栈帧，连续的过程调用会让栈不断朝着“栈顶”的方向进行扩展；在函数调用完成后，栈帧会被自动释放，栈也会随之缩减。在大多数体系结构上，</span><span data-lake-id="u3c262b76" id="u3c262b76" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈的扩展方向都是由高地址向低地址进行扩展。</span></p><p data-lake-id="7a685bfc295871f712d4078245c79dce" id="7a685bfc295871f712d4078245c79dce"><u><span data-lake-id="uf48baab4" id="uf48baab4" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈内存有什么特点</span></u><span data-lake-id="u84806c4d" id="u84806c4d" class="lake-fontsize-12">？</span></p><ul list="u552583e4"><li fid="u02b6d447" data-lake-id="u45bdee7e" id="u45bdee7e"><span data-lake-id="u12066f3d" id="u12066f3d" class="lake-fontsize-12">空间有限，尤其在嵌入式环境下。因此不可以用来存储尺寸太大的变量。linux 栈内存大小为 8M</span></li><li fid="u02b6d447" data-lake-id="u81073b2b" id="u81073b2b"><span data-lake-id="u57c00e35" id="u57c00e35" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">系统为函数分配栈内存时，遵循从上(高地址)往下(低地址)分配原则，</span><span data-lake-id="udb082203" id="udb082203" class="lake-fontsize-12">由系统规定的，我们无法干预</span></li><li fid="u02b6d447" data-lake-id="u1ac28f91" id="u1ac28f91" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u55329bec" id="u55329bec" class="lake-fontsize-12">每当一个函数被调用时，系统将自动分配一段栈内存给该函数，用于存放其局部变量，</span><span data-lake-id="u5c8b03e9" id="u5c8b03e9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">每当一个函数有退出时，系统将自动回收其栈内存</span></li><li fid="u02b6d447" data-lake-id="u68a9530d" id="u68a9530d"><em><span data-lake-id="ud925e32c" id="ud925e32c" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈空间申请的变量随着函数结束，空间</span></em><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u97e439bb" id="u97e439bb" class="lake-fontsize-12">自动释放</span></strong></em></li></ul><p data-lake-id="47d04dc6794c8bf03d924dc6192bef70" id="47d04dc6794c8bf03d924dc6192bef70" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560149583-9165d0e4-c804-4af1-8fdf-5c9f3f20a2fe.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A263%2C%22originHeight%22%3A161%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5eadf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r49YX%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="2d409e8c39ede4cda4b10e84b38f8ba6" id="2d409e8c39ede4cda4b10e84b38f8ba6"><span data-lake-id="u90c0376a" id="u90c0376a" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo1；</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20func(int%20a%2C%20int%20*p)%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20double%20f1%2C%20f2%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%5Cnint%20a%3B%2F%2F%20%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20m%20%20%3D%20100%3B%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20func(m%2C%20%26m)%3B%20%20%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ItH0Z%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="9646e90a75350eb2294d0bd3d7e6de9d" id="9646e90a75350eb2294d0bd3d7e6de9d"><span data-lake-id="uf97d8d0e" id="uf97d8d0e" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo2：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20max(int%20x%2C%20int%20y)%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20x%20%E5%92%8C%20y%20%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E5%9C%A8max()%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%88%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20z%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20z%20%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E5%9C%A8max()%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%88%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20z%20%3D%20x%3Ey%20%3F%20x%20%3A%20y%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20z%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%88%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84x%E3%80%81y%20%E5%92%8C%20z%20%E8%A2%AB%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9B%9E%E6%94%B6%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%201%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20a%20%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E5%9C%A8main()%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%88%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20b%20%3D%202%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20b%20%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E5%9C%A8main()%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%88%E4%B8%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20m%3B%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20m%20%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E5%9C%A8main()%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%88%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%AA%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E5%85%B6%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%BA%E9%9A%8F%E6%9C%BA%E5%80%BC%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20m%20%3D%20max(a%2C%20b)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CHdyW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="cf18ed932e29ae8a266dfe7d3565727d" id="cf18ed932e29ae8a266dfe7d3565727d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560149784-5d6ee119-ee0e-4099-b030-5154b3e0fb93.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A509%2C%22originHeight%22%3A234%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OZ25o%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="480868132531d101dfe754ea5985422d" id="480868132531d101dfe754ea5985422d"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22pVlTP%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u58f58537" id="u58f58537" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u45585448" id="u45585448" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf0e875ab" id="uf0e875ab" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">return之后不可再访问函数的局部变量，因此返回一个局部变量的地址通常是错误的。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="iGApY" id="iGApY"><span data-lake-id="udaef404e" id="udaef404e">1.2 数据段和代码段</span></h2><p data-lake-id="09b6338ca45cd8902a319da80da73c65" id="09b6338ca45cd8902a319da80da73c65" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560149959-dbd3c7c4-8ea7-490f-a0cb-992c686fc881.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A320%2C%22originHeight%22%3A163%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RneXl%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="23ba2b9eabacf0d2e857854f4cafe5c4" id="23ba2b9eabacf0d2e857854f4cafe5c4"><span data-lake-id="u5ac844d5" id="u5ac844d5" class="lake-fontsize-12">数据段细分成如下几个区域：</span></p><ul list="ubdcf146f"><li fid="uac8bed16" data-lake-id="u1ac2040f" id="u1ac2040f"><span data-lake-id="u5b28cea9" id="u5b28cea9" class="lake-fontsize-12">.bss 段(Block Started by Symbol)：未初始化的全局变量和静态局部变量保存在bss段，它们将被系统自动初始化为0。</span></li><li fid="uac8bed16" data-lake-id="ud3266e58" id="ud3266e58"><span data-lake-id="u545144f0" id="u545144f0" class="lake-fontsize-12">.data段(data segment)：</span><span data-lake-id="uc4d5b2de" id="uc4d5b2de" class="lake-fontsize-12">数据段。保存已经初始化的全局变量和静态局部变量。</span></li><li fid="uac8bed16" data-lake-id="ub227fa12" id="ub227fa12"><span data-lake-id="ua20b1446" id="ua20b1446" class="lake-fontsize-12">.rodata段（read only data）：只读数据段。存放的是只读数据，一般是程序里面的只读变量(const修饰的变量)、字符串、</span><u><span data-lake-id="ub57c1dd3" id="ub57c1dd3" class="lake-fontsize-12">常量</span></u><span data-lake-id="ue6a9aa8e" id="ue6a9aa8e" class="lake-fontsize-12">数据（printf 的格式化字符也算）。</span></li><li fid="uac8bed16" data-lake-id="uc01b5ed9" id="uc01b5ed9"><span data-lake-id="u404e1018" id="u404e1018" class="lake-fontsize-12">代码段细分成如下几个区域：</span></li><li fid="uac8bed16" data-lake-id="u42b8d4a3" id="u42b8d4a3"><span data-lake-id="uc711d394" id="uc711d394" class="lake-fontsize-12">.text段：存放用户代码</span></li><li fid="uac8bed16" data-lake-id="u180b7382" id="u180b7382"><span data-lake-id="u7c723789" id="u7c723789" class="lake-fontsize-12">.init段：存放系统初始化代码</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="DZM5z" id="DZM5z"><span data-lake-id="ub0fba3e5" id="ub0fba3e5">1.2.1 局部变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id="2a2d912bd7147729548f737ea8f294e1" id="2a2d912bd7147729548f737ea8f294e1" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u70a1594d" id="u70a1594d" class="lake-fontsize-12">在函数内部定义的变量是局部变量，其有效范围是局限于函数内部的，形参也是局部变量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufb991454" id="ufb991454" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u5bd36404" id="u5bd36404" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">凡是被一对花括号包含的变量，称为局部变量</span></p><ul list="u14fc3027"><li fid="ufb3745cb" data-lake-id="uf55eca00" id="uf55eca00"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)"><u><span data-lake-id="u8b912941" id="u8b912941" class="lake-fontsize-12">局部变量特点</span></u></span><span data-lake-id="u1e6dc0aa" id="u1e6dc0aa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">：</span></li></ul><ul list="u14fc3027" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u68795456" data-lake-id="u7d7f332a" id="u7d7f332a"><span data-lake-id="ub86c8359" id="ub86c8359" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">某一函数内部的局部变量，存储在该函数特定的栈内存中</span></li><li fid="u68795456" data-lake-id="u33e94e7b" id="u33e94e7b"><span data-lake-id="uaa127ea2" id="uaa127ea2" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">局部变量只能在该函数内可见，在该函数外部不可见</span></li><li fid="u68795456" data-lake-id="u4dbf5ae2" id="u4dbf5ae2"><span data-lake-id="u76be8364" id="u76be8364" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">当该函数退出后，局部变量所占用的内存立即被系统回收，因此局部变量也称为临时变量</span></li><li fid="u68795456" data-lake-id="uee704ceb" id="uee704ceb"><span data-lake-id="u3100d303" id="u3100d303" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">函数的形参虽然不被花括号包含，但依然属于该函数的局部变量</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%201%3B%20%20%20%20%2F*%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F*%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%88%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20int%20b%20%3D%202%3B%20%20%20%20%2F*%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%88%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%A7%E6%8B%AC%E5%8F%B7%E4%B9%8B%E5%86%85*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F*%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%88%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a)%3B%20%20%20%20%2F*%E5%87%BA%E4%BA%86%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%88%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8Fb%E5%B0%B1%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%86*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TGcvc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h3 data-lake-id="aywhu" id="aywhu"><span data-lake-id="u71047d39" id="u71047d39">1.2.2 全局变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id="99f3a2edf342c016f31176ca838d8cea" id="99f3a2edf342c016f31176ca838d8cea" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u58a77afc" id="u58a77afc" class="lake-fontsize-12">定义在函数外的变量，不属于任何函数。其作用范围是从定义开始到程序结束，对作用范围内所有的函数都起作用。</span></p><p data-lake-id="27b79312bd73d343b6a52765d2e329b7" id="27b79312bd73d343b6a52765d2e329b7" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u0e855242" id="u0e855242" class="lake-fontsize-12">全部变量的定义格式与局部变量完全一致，只是定义的位置不在函数内，它可以定义在函数的头部，也可以定义在两个函数的中间或程序尾部，只要在函数外部即可。</span></p><p data-lake-id="a6cb6c5e545d92cbbf3d1d34a282e4ed" id="a6cb6c5e545d92cbbf3d1d34a282e4ed" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u13f3d1bd" id="u13f3d1bd" class="lake-fontsize-12">当某函数的局部变量与全局变量同名时，那么全局变量在该函数中不起作用，局部变量起作用。若不存在同名变量的函数，那么全局变量仍然起作用。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20a%20%3D%202%2C%20b%20%3D%203%3B%5Cnvoid%20fun()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%206%2C%20b%20%3D%202%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%209%2C%20b%20%3D%200%3B%20%20%20%2F*%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8D%E5%90%88%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E6%8E%89%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%83%E5%90%8C%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%20%3D%20%25d%2C%20b%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a%2C%20b)%3B%20%20%20%2F*%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%9Aa%20%3D%209%2C%20b%20%3D%200*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%20%3D%20%25d%2C%20b%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a%2C%20b)%3B%20%20%20%2F*%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8Ca%E5%92%8Cb%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%A5%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%BC%80%E5%A4%B4%E5%A4%84%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84a%E5%92%8Cb%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%83%E4%BB%AC%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E6%8E%89%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%9Aa%20%3D%206%2C%20b%20%3D%202*%2F%5Cn%7D%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20fun()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%20%3D%20%25d%2C%20b%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a%2C%20b)%3B%2F*%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E7%9A%84a%E5%92%8Cb%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E7%9A%84a%E5%92%8Cb%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8C%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%9Aa%20%3D%202%2C%20b%20%3D%203*%2F%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sJQoj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u7e54b9d1" id="u7e54b9d1"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ue1b8d0ca" id="ue1b8d0ca"><span data-lake-id="u6c326bea" id="u6c326bea" class="lake-fontsize-12">c 语言中，静态数据有两种：</span></p><ul list="u1605696e"><li fid="u4e8249ab" data-lake-id="ue9981f0f" id="ue9981f0f"><span data-lake-id="u69a7ef72" id="u69a7ef72" class="lake-fontsize-12">全局变量：定义在函数外的变量</span></li><li fid="u4e8249ab" data-lake-id="uc163ad6c" id="uc163ad6c"><span data-lake-id="u6bac65f4" id="u6bac65f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">静态局部变量：</span><span data-lake-id="u2c59b767" id="u2c59b767" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">定义在函数内部，且被static修饰的变量</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="hfXHP" id="hfXHP"><span data-lake-id="uf6230d7e" id="uf6230d7e">1.2.3 静态局部变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id="02d4e79702feeeb2949f77c65a08b012" id="02d4e79702feeeb2949f77c65a08b012"><span data-lake-id="u0c08a89e" id="u0c08a89e" class="lake-fontsize-12"> 局部静态变量</span></p><p data-lake-id="042128e55308f1393c14744c30bba0a8" id="042128e55308f1393c14744c30bba0a8"><span data-lake-id="u2781cc3b" id="u2781cc3b" class="lake-fontsize-12">在局部变量之前加上关键字</span><span data-lake-id="u5fca29a1" id="u5fca29a1" class="lake-fontsize-12">static</span><span data-lake-id="ue3d0747a" id="ue3d0747a" class="lake-fontsize-12">，局部变量就被定义成为一个局部静态变量。</span></p><ul list="u9af96deb"><li fid="u1edb20ca" data-lake-id="u9d97421e" id="u9d97421e"><span data-lake-id="u630407c8" id="u630407c8" class="lake-fontsize-12">内存中的位置：静态存储区（使得局部变量由原来存储在栈内存，变成存储在静态存储区。）</span></li><li fid="u1edb20ca" data-lake-id="u3772e96c" id="u3772e96c"><span data-lake-id="u6cb4089e" id="u6cb4089e" class="lake-fontsize-12">初始化：未经初始化的局部静态变量会被程序自动初始化为0</span></li><li fid="u1edb20ca" data-lake-id="u3d916779" id="u3d916779"><span data-lake-id="u11e6947e" id="u11e6947e" class="lake-fontsize-12">作用域：作用域仍为局部作用域，当定义它的函数或者语句块结束的时候，作用域随之结束。</span></li><li fid="u1edb20ca" data-lake-id="uf4ca58e2" id="uf4ca58e2"><span data-lake-id="u1ac7e967" id="u1ac7e967" class="lake-fontsize-12">生存周期：当static用来修饰局部变量的时候，它就改变了局部变量的存储位置，从原来的栈中存放改为静态存储区。但是局部静态变量在离开作用域之后，并没有被销毁，而是仍然驻留在内存当中，直到程序结束</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnvoid%20f(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20static%20int%20b%20%3D%20200%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20b)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%2B%2B%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20f()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20f()%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%20f()%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%9A%E4%BD%BF%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20b%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%8D%E6%96%AD%E5%A2%9E%E5%A4%A7%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xo8R4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ue29ab3ba" id="ue29ab3ba"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22OklhP%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f232d64" id="u7f232d64" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><ul list="uc2d87218" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u86ef5c25" data-lake-id="ue1f1039b" id="ue1f1039b"><span data-lake-id="u3a7c11be" id="u3a7c11be" class="lake-fontsize-12">若定义时未初始化，则系统会将所有的静态数据自动初始化为0</span></li><li fid="u86ef5c25" data-lake-id="u32646428" id="u32646428"><span data-lake-id="ufb3a6aef" id="ufb3a6aef">静态数据初始化语句，只会执行一遍。</span></li><li fid="u86ef5c25" data-lake-id="u6f429c6d" id="u6f429c6d"><span data-lake-id="u68f52a31" id="u68f52a31" class="lake-fontsize-12">静态数据从程序开始运行时便已存在，直到程序退出时才释放。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u39d53dad" id="u39d53dad"><br></p><ul list="uc2d87218" start="4" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u86ef5c25" data-lake-id="u2409db6e" id="u2409db6e"><span data-lake-id="ud01378cb" id="ud01378cb" class="lake-fontsize-12">static修饰局部变量：使之由栈内存临时数据，变为静态数据</span></li><li fid="u86ef5c25" data-lake-id="ub965efb8" id="ub965efb8"><span data-lake-id="uff7380f9" id="uff7380f9" class="lake-fontsize-12">static修饰全局变量：使之由各文件可见的静态数据，变成为本文件可见的静态数据</span></li><li fid="u86ef5c25" data-lake-id="ufc4195c4" id="ufc4195c4"><span data-lake-id="ua178075b" id="ua178075b" class="lake-fontsize-12">static修饰的函数：使之由各文件可见的函数，变成为本文件可见的静态函数。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucfe37ea7" id="ucfe37ea7"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22static%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A5%2C%22id%22%3A%22qNM3n%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u78ff9878" id="u78ff9878" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E5%9C%A8C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8Cstatic%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E5%87%A0%E7%A7%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%5Cn1.%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8static%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E5%AE%83%E4%BB%AC%E5%9C%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8D%E6%B6%88%E5%A4%B1%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E5%A7%8B%E7%BB%88%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%AD%E3%80%82%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%E6%98%AF%E5%8F%AA%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%BF%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E8%A2%AB%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%A1%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E4%B9%9F%E4%BC%9A%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E3%80%82%5Cn%5Cn2.%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%9A%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8static%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E5%AE%83%E4%BB%AC%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%AE%83%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84%E6%BA%90%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%A2%AB%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%BA%90%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%5Cn%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E5%9F%9F%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%BA%90%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8C%E5%90%8D%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81%5Cn%5Cn3.%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8static%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E5%AE%83%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E8%A2%AB%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%86%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%BA%90%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%81%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%5Cn%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E5%A7%8B%E7%BB%88%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%AD%E3%80%82%5Cn%5Cn4.%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8static%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E8%A2%AB%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E5%AE%83%E4%BB%AC%E8%A2%AB%E8%AF%A5%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E6%89%80%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E4%BD%BF%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E4%BA%86%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E9%9D%99%E6%80%81%E6%88%90%E5%91%98%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E3%80%82%5Cn%5Cn%E6%80%BB%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%E4%B9%8B%EF%BC%8Cstatic%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E5%AD%97%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E6%98%AF%E6%94%B9%E5%8F%98%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E4%BD%BF%E5%AE%83%E4%BB%AC%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E6%88%96%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E5%9F%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%81%E6%80%A7%E5%8F%8A%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E3%80%82%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eu0iS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%EF%BC%9A%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9---%E3%80%8Bdemo%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PL0PR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="a544625b35bd17c03f05d5d914b4edf8" id="a544625b35bd17c03f05d5d914b4edf8"><span data-lake-id="u128ca4b6" id="u128ca4b6" class="lake-fontsize-12">总结：</span></p><p data-lake-id="73041d67dc0f3afbf967d1662943697a" id="73041d67dc0f3afbf967d1662943697a"><span data-lake-id="uaa314826" id="uaa314826" class="lake-fontsize-12">1、 为什么需要静态数据？</span></p><ul list="u83f85a93"><li fid="u3b376b0b" data-lake-id="u4bc4a1d5" id="u4bc4a1d5"><span data-lake-id="u13660c83" id="u13660c83" class="lake-fontsize-12">全局变量在默认的情况下，对所有文件可见，为某些需要在各个不同文件和函数间访问的数据提供操作上的方便。加上static以后，就只能本文件可见了，可以避免命名污染问题</span></li><li fid="u3b376b0b" data-lake-id="ue12241a3" id="ue12241a3"><span data-lake-id="ufce22f9a" id="ufce22f9a" class="lake-fontsize-12">当我们希望一个函数退出后依然能保留局部变量的值，以便于下次调用时还能用时，静态局部变量可帮助实现这样的功能。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="180c733e32387d5a188198d459dbd7cf" id="180c733e32387d5a188198d459dbd7cf"><span data-lake-id="ud4ad4d3f" id="ud4ad4d3f" class="lake-fontsize-12">2、</span></p><p data-lake-id="5b950f138fc46677c85f85abe1f31196" id="5b950f138fc46677c85f85abe1f31196"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560150184-68971cb1-9dee-4a9f-a8f7-9e8f86d4a4a6.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A404%2C%22originHeight%22%3A213%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f3f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jEDtK%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="ze34T" id="ze34T"><span data-lake-id="u8a0e070d" id="u8a0e070d">1.3 堆内存</span></h2><p data-lake-id="3a859462217fb08d22ed17eb0b40afaf" id="3a859462217fb08d22ed17eb0b40afaf" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u6a3efdb2" id="u6a3efdb2" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆内存（heap）又被称为动态内存、自由内存，简称堆。堆是唯一可被开发者自定义的区段，开发者可以根据需要申请内存的大小、决定使用的时间长短等。但又由于这是一块系统“飞地”，所有的细节均由开发者自己把握，系统不对此做任何干预，给予开发者绝对的“自由”，但也正因如此，对开发者的内存管理提出了很高的要求。对堆内存的合理使用，几乎是软件开发中的一个永恒的话题。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u51869282" id="u51869282" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u7ac79860" id="u7ac79860" class="lake-fontsize-12"> 例如 malloc 它分配的内存来自进程的虚拟内存空间。虚拟内存是操作系统提供的一种内存管理机制，它允许程序使用比物理内存更多的内存  </span></p><p data-lake-id="05c366430680ebb49d9b9fb8bd47810a" id="05c366430680ebb49d9b9fb8bd47810a"><span data-lake-id="u5bd833bd" id="u5bd833bd" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="332a1385bd38c8633b870d789fdd71d2" id="332a1385bd38c8633b870d789fdd71d2"><span data-lake-id="ud8f9d21d" id="ud8f9d21d" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆内存基本特征：</span></p><ul list="uc2033b78"><li fid="u8ff98c8f" data-lake-id="ud5a31a33" id="ud5a31a33"><span data-lake-id="ua8d7426d" id="ua8d7426d" class="lake-fontsize-12">相比栈内存，堆的总大小仅受限于物理内存，在物理内存允许的范围内，系统对堆内存的申请不做限制。</span></li><li fid="u8ff98c8f" data-lake-id="u31b90e15" id="u31b90e15"><span data-lake-id="u7df36b92" id="u7df36b92" class="lake-fontsize-12">相比栈内存，堆内存从下往上增长。</span></li><li fid="u8ff98c8f" data-lake-id="u8695c008" id="u8695c008"><span data-lake-id="u2ac54e60" id="u2ac54e60" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆内存是匿名的，只能由指针来访问。</span></li><li fid="u8ff98c8f" data-lake-id="u16fbc4ad" id="u16fbc4ad"><span data-lake-id="ufb22df65" id="ufb22df65" class="lake-fontsize-12">自定义分配的堆内存，除非开发者主动释放，否则永不释放，直到程序退出。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ca55f85d33e76367008c22db38bb8b8b" id="ca55f85d33e76367008c22db38bb8b8b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560150359-00952962-77a1-4ce3-9a8a-d56b126c8777.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A508%2C%22height%22%3A254%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A615%2C%22originHeight%22%3A308%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6de%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TyREm%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="827c102f361749fb73a37bc6180fbd7e" id="827c102f361749fb73a37bc6180fbd7e"><span data-lake-id="ud66b88fd" id="ud66b88fd" class="lake-fontsize-12">相关API：</span></p><ul list="ube816010"><li fid="u41412d42" data-lake-id="ua62c9e92" id="ua62c9e92"><span data-lake-id="u0cf93031" id="u0cf93031" class="lake-fontsize-12">申请堆内存：malloc() / calloc()</span></li><li fid="u41412d42" data-lake-id="ub511a4b0" id="ub511a4b0"><span data-lake-id="uf013c638" id="uf013c638" class="lake-fontsize-12">清零堆内存：bzero()</span></li><li fid="u41412d42" data-lake-id="uda86923a" id="uda86923a"><span data-lake-id="uf0081669" id="uf0081669" class="lake-fontsize-12">释放堆内存：free()</span></li></ul><table data-lake-id="VHkGq" id="VHkGq" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 634px"><colgroup><col width="173"><col width="211"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ufdf91319" id="ufdf91319" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u04ebf714" id="u04ebf714"><p data-lake-id="b318fb64fa23ed9cef4163fefc4f7107" id="b318fb64fa23ed9cef4163fefc4f7107"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8a17e16" id="ub8a17e16" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u85b4eb77" id="u85b4eb77" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="124ec1e06458d2be448180794b6ce02c" id="124ec1e06458d2be448180794b6ce02c"><span data-lake-id="ue401aace" id="ue401aace" class="lake-fontsize-12">申请堆内存</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u379dd4bd" id="u379dd4bd" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u1a726c9b" id="u1a726c9b"><p data-lake-id="08dd8bdaceb568fe71e15f25575f181a" id="08dd8bdaceb568fe71e15f25575f181a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb876d86" id="ueb876d86" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubeb526d8" id="ubeb526d8" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="5567d906636058adda14714118dcdfa6" id="5567d906636058adda14714118dcdfa6"><span data-lake-id="u067e73b1" id="u067e73b1" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2178d5ed" id="u2178d5ed" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u0f58f3ef" id="u0f58f3ef"><p data-lake-id="1ca9ea48549f3c6e94d4f6ec89603e84" id="1ca9ea48549f3c6e94d4f6ec89603e84"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueef8508e" id="ueef8508e" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua0a192b5" id="ua0a192b5" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="832ec6db202c1d965b8bcebf6b4fd5c7" id="832ec6db202c1d965b8bcebf6b4fd5c7"><span data-lake-id="u47d293a3" id="u47d293a3" class="lake-fontsize-12">void *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uff8fd273" id="uff8fd273" class="lake-fontsize-12">malloc</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucbf4caed" id="ucbf4caed" class="lake-fontsize-12">(size_t size);</span></p><p data-lake-id="5dbf14a422fd1540b1976358a1a511dd" id="5dbf14a422fd1540b1976358a1a511dd"><span data-lake-id="u46945607" id="u46945607" class="lake-fontsize-12">void *</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u30065574" id="u30065574" class="lake-fontsize-12">calloc</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub34824ac" id="ub34824ac" class="lake-fontsize-12">(size_t count, size_t</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf1e6c806" id="uf1e6c806" class="lake-fontsize-12"> size)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue2a5763c" id="ue2a5763c" class="lake-fontsize-12">;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ude2613f0" id="ude2613f0" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ud25bad95" id="ud25bad95" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="836009dc04bb0e62043752aba80bc439" id="836009dc04bb0e62043752aba80bc439"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e7e087b" id="u4e7e087b" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubc36495b" id="ubc36495b"><p data-lake-id="85ee2f7cbd70b5e047acc9db370c192f" id="85ee2f7cbd70b5e047acc9db370c192f"><span data-lake-id="u637c2a5e" id="u637c2a5e" class="lake-fontsize-12">size</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3e1433aa" id="u3e1433aa"><p data-lake-id="92b739ee5f15268bfff7c4e92785ed7d" id="92b739ee5f15268bfff7c4e92785ed7d"><span data-lake-id="udd833bf3" id="udd833bf3" class="lake-fontsize-12">所申请的一块堆内存的大小，单位是字节</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u11cfd665" id="u11cfd665" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="uda69be95" id="uda69be95"><p data-lake-id="dbb6ad19405cca69fb95ca85aedfb488" id="dbb6ad19405cca69fb95ca85aedfb488"><span data-lake-id="u7e15891d" id="u7e15891d" class="lake-fontsize-12">count</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7c709d33" id="u7c709d33"><p data-lake-id="321229f36f5f265897784de5449d1477" id="321229f36f5f265897784de5449d1477"><span data-lake-id="u648a3137" id="u648a3137" class="lake-fontsize-12">所申请的堆内存的块数，所有的内存块是连续分布的、无间隔的</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ue27ccd50" id="ue27ccd50" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u558b0c6b" id="u558b0c6b" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="c03e7ef80d6a6c1e34acfbc57a87424c" id="c03e7ef80d6a6c1e34acfbc57a87424c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5d1807a0" id="u5d1807a0" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue8a186ea" id="ue8a186ea"><p data-lake-id="e6a2c78873b1cf895dfdd32ede2f34ab" id="e6a2c78873b1cf895dfdd32ede2f34ab"><span data-lake-id="u2abe5d45" id="u2abe5d45" class="lake-fontsize-12">成功</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8bb4744b" id="u8bb4744b"><p data-lake-id="d9dafaefb3f8ab9a1af599fad1da1757" id="d9dafaefb3f8ab9a1af599fad1da1757"><span data-lake-id="ue8be262f" id="ue8be262f" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回所申请的内存空间的指针</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ubd5d1a50" id="ubd5d1a50" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ud57dd2b0" id="ud57dd2b0"><p data-lake-id="6a01df45e718d7a0ea69a6738247df85" id="6a01df45e718d7a0ea69a6738247df85"><span data-lake-id="u82780c35" id="u82780c35" class="lake-fontsize-12">失败</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue7154bc7" id="ue7154bc7"><p data-lake-id="5b277a85488647e5b9d721d6768eee60" id="5b277a85488647e5b9d721d6768eee60"><span data-lake-id="u505c2d19" id="u505c2d19" class="lake-fontsize-12">NULL</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="464414b9d374fdd935e6ac2adba6cd24" id="464414b9d374fdd935e6ac2adba6cd24"><span data-lake-id="ub2c9dc49" id="ub2c9dc49" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><table data-lake-id="hvdNL" id="hvdNL" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 612px"><colgroup><col width="160"><col width="202"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u5e9a5c23" id="u5e9a5c23" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u30679b3d" id="u30679b3d"><p data-lake-id="edce309f214d2f740d33b577cf3fa14a" id="edce309f214d2f740d33b577cf3fa14a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud512c0f0" id="ud512c0f0" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9e831c8a" id="u9e831c8a" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="b694cbf845cf9ffe0563fd6e5ba1956a" id="b694cbf845cf9ffe0563fd6e5ba1956a"><span data-lake-id="u2c50158c" id="u2c50158c" class="lake-fontsize-12">清零指定内存</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ucb33fd18" id="ucb33fd18" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="udeaf7c6e" id="udeaf7c6e"><p data-lake-id="edcbb6b1ef0fc1584730b9a3a40c6739" id="edcbb6b1ef0fc1584730b9a3a40c6739"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3dba403" id="ub3dba403" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u9c86b35a" id="u9c86b35a" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="07257242a9e838580636a0313b094b25" id="07257242a9e838580636a0313b094b25"><span data-lake-id="ue73b7576" id="ue73b7576" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;strings.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u49d4e653" id="u49d4e653" style="height: 38px"><td data-lake-id="u4b06dc44" id="u4b06dc44"><p data-lake-id="2119b94c96e219932db63db405a94f1b" id="2119b94c96e219932db63db405a94f1b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u818f68e7" id="u818f68e7" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u09857c8e" id="u09857c8e" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="9b26cc794034685183142733fbd8bd75" id="9b26cc794034685183142733fbd8bd75"><span data-lake-id="u03ae2ec0" id="u03ae2ec0" class="lake-fontsize-12">void bzero(void *s, size_t n);</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4a278af7" id="u4a278af7" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u32b53455" id="u32b53455" rowSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="5bda6be12c8d9615d73654cbef307559" id="5bda6be12c8d9615d73654cbef307559"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1438b5d0" id="u1438b5d0" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub3f18a9c" id="ub3f18a9c"><p data-lake-id="bdb82390be2a1448349d1efe172fd0b0" id="bdb82390be2a1448349d1efe172fd0b0"><span data-lake-id="u00683459" id="u00683459" class="lake-fontsize-12">s</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8e39bd09" id="u8e39bd09"><p data-lake-id="c1ed9a0d7ca2a49b7d9e08d389573edc" id="c1ed9a0d7ca2a49b7d9e08d389573edc"><span data-lake-id="u0ddccf6d" id="u0ddccf6d" class="lake-fontsize-12">指向要清零的内存的指针</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uf6e4a507" id="uf6e4a507" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u03516533" id="u03516533"><p data-lake-id="66fda65422c856e4e4af9c7746077889" id="66fda65422c856e4e4af9c7746077889"><span data-lake-id="ua9cfebd1" id="ua9cfebd1" class="lake-fontsize-12">n</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6700d9b6" id="u6700d9b6"><p data-lake-id="ae6945ffbf3ff6abe85dacf0b8a5facf" id="ae6945ffbf3ff6abe85dacf0b8a5facf"><span data-lake-id="u063c7ecf" id="u063c7ecf" class="lake-fontsize-12">要清零的内存大小，单位是字节</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua037a538" id="ua037a538" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="ue6bb6b03" id="ue6bb6b03"><p data-lake-id="6fa819566530f71d8103eadc71f9584f" id="6fa819566530f71d8103eadc71f9584f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u90404793" id="u90404793" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3cee561a" id="u3cee561a" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="d6ebfded3c2e5e4705d1be5630e13d45" id="d6ebfded3c2e5e4705d1be5630e13d45"><span data-lake-id="u343aa2ba" id="u343aa2ba" class="lake-fontsize-12">无</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table data-lake-id="uMmW4" id="uMmW4" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 610px"><colgroup><col width="161"><col width="199"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="uf8bf0545" id="uf8bf0545" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u659dab16" id="u659dab16"><p data-lake-id="617d661d61030f3b0b5e92902b0fbfd2" id="617d661d61030f3b0b5e92902b0fbfd2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u63b0253a" id="u63b0253a" class="lake-fontsize-12">功能</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u02bd0f00" id="u02bd0f00" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="8c42e7ff96980d006ce6637470cfe875" id="8c42e7ff96980d006ce6637470cfe875"><span data-lake-id="u474ed242" id="u474ed242" class="lake-fontsize-12">释放堆内存</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u22c24deb" id="u22c24deb" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u6f058e0a" id="u6f058e0a"><p data-lake-id="27eac47f951b7075d3786c6194caf2be" id="27eac47f951b7075d3786c6194caf2be"><strong><span data-lake-id="u85663978" id="u85663978" class="lake-fontsize-12">所需头文件</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8decebff" id="u8decebff" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="1b44bbd55a40206563923c57358776fd" id="1b44bbd55a40206563923c57358776fd"><span data-lake-id="u553ee7cf" id="u553ee7cf" class="lake-fontsize-12">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub4131356" id="ub4131356" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u87468253" id="u87468253"><p data-lake-id="a679cd09ff41c61907daaffef4c635ef" id="a679cd09ff41c61907daaffef4c635ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf15d04e3" id="uf15d04e3" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数原型</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u48694b48" id="u48694b48" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="af0483b82c6400ad9e5c64ece10ffbd6" id="af0483b82c6400ad9e5c64ece10ffbd6"><span data-lake-id="u485efca1" id="u485efca1" class="lake-fontsize-12">void </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5f51f07" id="ue5f51f07" class="lake-fontsize-12">free</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6a3ae9f4" id="u6a3ae9f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">(void *ptr);</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u04127a1d" id="u04127a1d" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u7d4704dd" id="u7d4704dd"><p data-lake-id="01110aa3e2f1e2c103e7fe376d68d6d0" id="01110aa3e2f1e2c103e7fe376d68d6d0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e724378" id="u6e724378" class="lake-fontsize-12">参数</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="uda6f1b60" id="uda6f1b60"><p data-lake-id="c8af1db264711a66d5ae745c81191b58" id="c8af1db264711a66d5ae745c81191b58"><span data-lake-id="u4cce9f1f" id="u4cce9f1f" class="lake-fontsize-12">ptr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5ae15bca" id="u5ae15bca"><p data-lake-id="bccf5e0b973778d9c2bf19f8f25622e6" id="bccf5e0b973778d9c2bf19f8f25622e6"><span data-lake-id="u92a3d3fb" id="u92a3d3fb" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆内存指针</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ud628799b" id="ud628799b" style="height: 33px"><td data-lake-id="u2378991b" id="u2378991b"><p data-lake-id="890086fad4689b6e8ec01c390d19fba5" id="890086fad4689b6e8ec01c390d19fba5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fccb1e6" id="u8fccb1e6" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回值</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2d42e35c" id="u2d42e35c" colSpan="2"><p data-lake-id="e70fa44ead7d2994a76637239c35544c" id="e70fa44ead7d2994a76637239c35544c"><span data-lake-id="ubc8efe80" id="ubc8efe80" class="lake-fontsize-12">无</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u8101e700" id="u8101e700"><span data-lake-id="u52b73541" id="u52b73541" class="lake-fontsize-12">其实还有一个：</span></p><ul list="ua0a6032b"><li fid="u6f026e06" data-lake-id="uab61fdb6" id="uab61fdb6" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u5abb8bf6" id="u5abb8bf6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">realloc()申请的堆内存,在原来内存基础上可进行扩容。</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E5%A0%86%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*p%20%3D%20calloc(1%2Csizeof(char))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(p%20%3D%3D%20NULL)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22calloc%20failed%3A%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20-1%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20buf%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22afjoiajfajflajlfjalflafjslfjsljfls%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%89%A9%E5%AE%B9%2C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%A9%E5%AE%B9%E4%BC%9A%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*ptr%20%3D%20realloc(p%2C100)%3B%2F%2F%E6%89%A9%E5%AE%B9%E5%88%B0100%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%89%A9%E5%AE%B9%E4%BA%86100%EF%BC%89%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ztg0J%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="f0c134e65d274593b2e6055a4036a9cc" id="f0c134e65d274593b2e6055a4036a9cc"><span data-lake-id="ud7859822" id="ud7859822" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20*p%20%3D%20malloc(sizeof(int))%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B71%E5%9D%97%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E4%B8%BA%20sizeof(int)%20%E7%9A%84%E5%A0%86%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%5Cnbzero(p%2C%20sizeof(int))%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E5%88%9A%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E7%9A%84%E5%A0%86%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%B8%85%E9%9B%B6%5Cn%5Cn*p%20%3D%20100%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%20100%20%E6%94%BE%E5%85%A5%E5%A0%86%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%AD%5Cnfree(p)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E5%A0%86%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vqhhr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="d2ef9ef7d68e4d7dbf4fe766d019d7bb" id="d2ef9ef7d68e4d7dbf4fe766d019d7bb"><span data-lake-id="u68664c17" id="u68664c17" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><ul list="ub9b62044"><li fid="ud5d900c1" data-lake-id="uc3afe890" id="uc3afe890"><span data-lake-id="u7a577cf4" id="u7a577cf4" class="lake-fontsize-12">malloc()申请的堆内存，默认情况下是随机值，一般需要用 bzero() 来清零。</span></li><li fid="ud5d900c1" data-lake-id="u36f6f20f" id="u36f6f20f"><span data-lake-id="u01dbe68c" id="u01dbe68c" class="lake-fontsize-12">calloc()申请的堆内存，默认情况下是已经清零了的，不需要再清零。</span></li><li fid="ud5d900c1" data-lake-id="u1555c773" id="u1555c773"><span data-lake-id="ubba475ba" id="ubba475ba" class="lake-fontsize-12">free()只能释放堆内存，不能释放别的区段的内存。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="3cf72cb8f8e92cc17d3b6a90206665ff" id="3cf72cb8f8e92cc17d3b6a90206665ff"><span data-lake-id="ucdcc5ff7" id="ucdcc5ff7" class="lake-fontsize-12">释放内存的含义：</span></p><ul list="u6f683016"><li fid="u8a0c1ae0" data-lake-id="uabafb1f7" id="uabafb1f7"><span data-lake-id="u7435e4b0" id="u7435e4b0" class="lake-fontsize-12">释放内存意味着将内存的使用权归还给系统。</span></li><li fid="u8a0c1ae0" data-lake-id="uc70111a2" id="uc70111a2"><span data-lake-id="uc2780aba" id="uc2780aba" class="lake-fontsize-12">释放内存并不会改变指针的指向。</span></li><li fid="u8a0c1ae0" data-lake-id="u6f0dbf76" id="u6f0dbf76"><span data-lake-id="u01787b1c" id="u01787b1c" class="lake-fontsize-12">释放内存并不会对内存做任何修改，更不会将内存清零。</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="VpWjy" id="VpWjy"><span data-lake-id="u3075493e" id="u3075493e">2.问与答</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="ZbRbo" id="ZbRbo"><span data-lake-id="uaafb35b7" id="uaafb35b7">2.1 堆与栈的区别</span></h2><p data-lake-id="848fb8b9b252a7c3d6ba48e8754b73c8" id="848fb8b9b252a7c3d6ba48e8754b73c8"><span data-lake-id="u65c40e88" id="u65c40e88" class="lake-fontsize-12">1、 管理方式不同:</span></p><ul list="u9f97cb4d"><li fid="ub3d80cb8" data-lake-id="u443504ae" id="u443504ae"><span data-lake-id="ubb134fb7" id="ubb134fb7" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈：由系统自动分配空间，同时系统自动释放空间。</span></li><li fid="ub3d80cb8" data-lake-id="u04e806a3" id="u04e806a3"><span data-lake-id="ub5707976" id="ub5707976" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆：需要程序员手动申请并且手动释放，并指明大小。在C语言中malloc函数申请，释放free函数，在C＋＋中new和delete实现。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="f97a116399716a1eca43427f5b6c7f63" id="f97a116399716a1eca43427f5b6c7f63"><span data-lake-id="u153235f3" id="u153235f3" class="lake-fontsize-12">2、 存储内容不同:</span></p><ul list="ua71cd6ec"><li fid="ue0c47079" data-lake-id="u2ae92306" id="u2ae92306"><span data-lake-id="u2bbe1ebb" id="u2bbe1ebb" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈：在函数调用时，栈中存放的是函数中各个参数(局部变量)</span></li><li fid="ue0c47079" data-lake-id="uae3c36aa" id="uae3c36aa"><span data-lake-id="ufbee5289" id="ufbee5289" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆：一般是在堆的头部用一个字节存放堆的大小（不是必须的）。堆中的具体内容由程序员安排。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="97c2a3d30531ea96f026a6b7e4c704ba" id="97c2a3d30531ea96f026a6b7e4c704ba"><span data-lake-id="u9239d9f7" id="u9239d9f7" class="lake-fontsize-12">3、 空间大小不同:</span></p><ul list="ue34546e9"><li fid="uab468b68" data-lake-id="u4d2ee744" id="u4d2ee744"><span data-lake-id="ubc130595" id="ubc130595" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈：获取空间较小。</span></li><li fid="uab468b68" data-lake-id="ue0e4d33e" id="ue0e4d33e"><span data-lake-id="uf849e2f3" id="uf849e2f3" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆：比较灵活，比较大。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="150a4f5662efe8d3b667b80f095fb388" id="150a4f5662efe8d3b667b80f095fb388"><span data-lake-id="u12407d8d" id="u12407d8d" class="lake-fontsize-12">4、 能否产生碎片不同:</span></p><ul list="uabc92d6a"><li fid="u345fdcd7" data-lake-id="u1610a06d" id="u1610a06d"><span data-lake-id="u32f0dc2c" id="u32f0dc2c" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈：不会产生碎片，空间连续。</span></li><li fid="u345fdcd7" data-lake-id="ued698136" id="ued698136"><span data-lake-id="ucd0c6c8a" id="ucd0c6c8a" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆：采用的是链表的存储方式，会产生碎片。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="91427c63fdafe81d2944ea56c7a3f393" id="91427c63fdafe81d2944ea56c7a3f393"><span data-lake-id="ue24370b9" id="ue24370b9" class="lake-fontsize-12">5、 分配方式不同:</span></p><ul list="u8e63cf36"><li fid="ufdec875a" data-lake-id="u78fb852e" id="u78fb852e"><span data-lake-id="udf10576a" id="udf10576a" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈：静态分配，由编译器完成</span></li><li fid="ufdec875a" data-lake-id="ud46098a0" id="ud46098a0"><span data-lake-id="uf3112c31" id="uf3112c31" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆：动态分配的，使用malloc函数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="696fd2dd388482e10753d5532ad6b18c" id="696fd2dd388482e10753d5532ad6b18c"><span data-lake-id="u1bbcd498" id="u1bbcd498" class="lake-fontsize-12">6、 分配效率不同</span></p><ul list="u87372e5f"><li fid="u58a1f796" data-lake-id="u895f5bd2" id="u895f5bd2"><span data-lake-id="u93973221" id="u93973221" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈：由系统自动分配，速度较快。但程序员是无法控制的。</span></li><li fid="u58a1f796" data-lake-id="u0ea43efc" id="u0ea43efc"><span data-lake-id="uda1fd320" id="uda1fd320" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆：由malloc分配的内存，一般速度比较慢，而且容易产生内存碎片，不过用起来方便。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="2266469961ea83e6df8ae52f9b2191d6" id="2266469961ea83e6df8ae52f9b2191d6"><span data-lake-id="u494342eb" id="u494342eb" class="lake-fontsize-12">7、 生长方向不同</span></p><ul list="u92cd66c6"><li fid="u6fd88ed6" data-lake-id="u2c26b143" id="u2c26b143"><span data-lake-id="u7d21dd69" id="u7d21dd69" class="lake-fontsize-12">栈：向低地址扩展的数据结构，是一块连续的内存的区域。</span></li><li fid="u6fd88ed6" data-lake-id="u53299ab1" id="u53299ab1"><span data-lake-id="u1f0b3e15" id="u1f0b3e15" class="lake-fontsize-12">堆：向高地址扩展的数据结构，是不连续的内存区域。这是由于系统是用链表来存储的空闲内存地址的，自然是不连续的，而链表的遍历方向是由低地址向高地址。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="b26826915e15195f79de8d5a7f860ac4" id="b26826915e15195f79de8d5a7f860ac4"><span data-lake-id="u229d36d1" id="u229d36d1" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="c358a0105a97c02f5e2675f4f4797b21" id="c358a0105a97c02f5e2675f4f4797b21"><span data-lake-id="u37af778a" id="u37af778a" class="lake-fontsize-12">为什么要有堆空间？</span></p><ul list="u0625be17"><li fid="uf113ef8f" data-lake-id="u068c01bc" id="u068c01bc"><span data-lake-id="u01247017" id="u01247017" class="lake-fontsize-12"> 为了弥补静态内存分配的缺点：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="18f605332f566f6b53b0c9923689de26" id="18f605332f566f6b53b0c9923689de26"><span data-lake-id="u1ba7b4d4" id="u1ba7b4d4" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数里直接定义数组，数组的内存分配在栈stack里面，函数返回数组内存就会被释放，malloc的内存分配在堆heap里面，函数返回后heap分配的内存不会自动释放</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20*%20fun()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%5B5%5D%3D%7B1%2C2%2C3%2C4%2C5%7D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20*a%3Dfun()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca%5B0%5D)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F%2Fwarning%3A%20function%20returns%20address%20of%20local%20variable%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cbVq1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="9e72d6fe5ac472f8137e5875707fa545" id="9e72d6fe5ac472f8137e5875707fa545"><span data-lake-id="ucf55ac26" id="ucf55ac26" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdlib.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20*%20fun()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20*a%20%3D%20malloc(5*4)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20a%5B0%5D%3D100%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20*a%3Dfun()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca%5B0%5D)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HKuIX%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u3113c6b0"><li fid="u09a3b79b" data-lake-id="u42399a5c" id="u42399a5c"><span data-lake-id="u21b3713f" id="u21b3713f" class="lake-fontsize-12">数据结构-链表</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="daaa8b8b0d86e2cae1148d5a2328cb3e" id="daaa8b8b0d86e2cae1148d5a2328cb3e"><span data-lake-id="u892d4cf3" id="u892d4cf3" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="Mmb8C" id="Mmb8C"><span data-lake-id="ue69dee1c" id="ue69dee1c">2.2 linux环境下gcc编译c文件生成可执行文件的四个步骤是什么？</span></h2><p data-lake-id="1c067024e4d355bf046206be336836eb" id="1c067024e4d355bf046206be336836eb" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ud23f47e7" id="ud23f47e7" class="lake-fontsize-12">我们平时使用的工具一般都是流行的集成开发 环境（ IDE），比如 Visual Studio，这些功能强大的 IDE 通常将编译和链接合并到一 起，也就是构建（ Build） 或运行（ Run） 。即使在 Linux 下使用命令行来编译一个源文件，简单的一句gcc  demo.c 也包含了非常复杂的过程。那么源代码生成可执行文件的内部机理是什么呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id="c3983a2063b85765b71e54837fa21cf8" id="c3983a2063b85765b71e54837fa21cf8" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u0051c710" id="u0051c710" class="lake-fontsize-12">linux下gcc编译c文件为可执行文件分为四个步骤，分别是 预处理、编译、汇编、链接（Preprocessing、Compilation、Assembly、Linking）</span></p><p data-lake-id="47a8a1cedffc34e63fea137c42fdf61c" id="47a8a1cedffc34e63fea137c42fdf61c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560150562-5b07a39f-66e2-4c9c-8ed2-eb8fde23a006.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A658%2C%22height%22%3A190%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1071%2C%22originHeight%22%3A310%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YwLhZ%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><ol list="u0368b52c"><li fid="u44f2952c" data-lake-id="u409675c5" id="u409675c5"><span data-lake-id="u81e1c6dc" id="u81e1c6dc" class="lake-fontsize-12"> 预处理(生成hello.i文件)</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="959697f2d03a4c4e0f060749116b465b" id="959697f2d03a4c4e0f060749116b465b" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ue6aaee74" id="ue6aaee74" class="lake-fontsize-12">预编译的处理规则：</span></p><ul list="uef5951e2"><li fid="u577ad6ac" data-lake-id="u782d67c6" id="u782d67c6"><span data-lake-id="ub724fa08" id="ub724fa08" class="lake-fontsize-12">将所有的 “#define” 删除，并展开所有的宏定义。 </span></li><li fid="u577ad6ac" data-lake-id="uf5e05775" id="uf5e05775"><span data-lake-id="ued7784c5" id="ued7784c5" class="lake-fontsize-12">处理所有的条件预编译指令，⽐如：&quot; #if #ifdef #elif #else #endif &quot;。</span></li><li fid="u577ad6ac" data-lake-id="ucaaebedd" id="ucaaebedd"><span data-lake-id="u821a53d3" id="u821a53d3" class="lake-fontsize-12">处理所有的 “#include” 预编译指令，将被包含文件的内容插入到该命令所在的位置，这与复制粘贴的效果一样</span></li><li fid="u577ad6ac" data-lake-id="u2a263047" id="u2a263047"><span data-lake-id="u13cdf542" id="u13cdf542" class="lake-fontsize-12">删除所有的注释 “//” 、 “/* */”。</span></li><li fid="u577ad6ac" data-lake-id="uf4d13f5a" id="uf4d13f5a"><span data-lake-id="u8afc40a8" id="u8afc40a8" class="lake-fontsize-12">添加⾏号和⽂件名标识，以便编译时产⽣的⾏号信息以及⽤于编译错误或警告时能够显⽰⾏号。</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gcc%20-E%20hello.c%20-o%20hello.i%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V2KOH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ol list="u0368b52c" start="2"><li fid="u44f2952c" data-lake-id="ua25d0878" id="ua25d0878"><span data-lake-id="u95db3c6c" id="u95db3c6c" class="lake-fontsize-12">编译 (⽣成汇编代码 hello.s)</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="8042f5b5a5259e96066428bb06479195" id="8042f5b5a5259e96066428bb06479195" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u38128c10" id="u38128c10" class="lake-fontsize-12">编译过程是编译器gcc把预处理完的⽂件进⾏词法分析、语法分析、语义分析及优化后⽣成相应的汇编代码⽂件，编译是整个程序构建的核心部分，也是最复杂的部分之一，详情请查看《编译原理》</span></p><p data-lake-id="70e5ff3a928cf922d90082e2de5482a5" id="70e5ff3a928cf922d90082e2de5482a5"><span data-lake-id="uf6dd7b78" id="uf6dd7b78" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="e1aa5e8372c70739119a5861431dee11" id="e1aa5e8372c70739119a5861431dee11"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560150792-c138702f-aa52-4bdf-970d-01ac18e79739.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A193%2C%22height%22%3A232%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A500%2C%22originHeight%22%3A601%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e0e1e3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hw0go%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="9ad1125f9b84aff9d880841a0505715e" id="9ad1125f9b84aff9d880841a0505715e"><span data-lake-id="uea7a2ae9" id="uea7a2ae9" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="de0bedb7212ecf09a7286e108fb2d341" id="de0bedb7212ecf09a7286e108fb2d341"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560151005-151afd08-1eca-4e5d-83ff-1707232295c7.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A280%2C%22height%22%3A211%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A640%2C%22originHeight%22%3A483%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23838c8b%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k6O0i%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gcc%20-S%20hello.i%20-o%20hello.s%20%E6%88%96%E8%80%85%20%20gcc%20-S%20hello.c%20-o%20hello.s%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qoG5S%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ol list="u0368b52c" start="3"><li fid="u44f2952c" data-lake-id="u9b2fb20b" id="u9b2fb20b"><span data-lake-id="u4186f18b" id="u4186f18b" class="lake-fontsize-12">汇编 (⽣成 hello.o⽂件 )</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="cd5478917499e7e409ac4aa9f2ced72f" id="cd5478917499e7e409ac4aa9f2ced72f" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u905374e3" id="u905374e3" class="lake-fontsize-12">汇编是汇编器把汇编代码转变成中间⽬标⽂件。根据汇编语句 和机器指令的对照表一一翻译就可以了。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gcc%20-c%20hello.s%20-o%20hello.o%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E90Yu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ol list="u0368b52c" start="4"><li fid="u44f2952c" data-lake-id="udaf9516d" id="udaf9516d"><span data-lake-id="ua72e8dda" id="ua72e8dda" class="lake-fontsize-12">链接（⽣成可执⾏程序）</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="71af8e2e998a2728729ab3ecaabbab0f" id="71af8e2e998a2728729ab3ecaabbab0f" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u92cc25dc" id="u92cc25dc" class="lake-fontsize-12">负责将程序的⽬标⽂件与所需的所有附加的⽬标⽂件连接起来，附加的⽬标⽂件包括静态连接库和动态连接库。库文件是由系统提供，里面包括内置的标准函数和数据结构集合等，我们代码中使用的 &lt;stdio.h&gt; 就是标准库提供的，里面定义 printf 这个函数。</span></p><p data-lake-id="866a74d624ebe43a35e9654074d6eaa4" id="866a74d624ebe43a35e9654074d6eaa4"><span data-lake-id="u4b3e3909" id="u4b3e3909" class="lake-fontsize-12">中间⽬标⽂件和相应的库⼀起链接成为可执⾏⽂件</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gcc%20hello.o%20-o%20hello%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jDMGg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="84e3f26eb0ba2d76cf38738853d2726c" id="84e3f26eb0ba2d76cf38738853d2726c"><span data-lake-id="u80b04709" id="u80b04709" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="Xaaov" id="Xaaov"><span data-lake-id="ufb8da71f" id="ufb8da71f">2.3 测试栈内存的大小</span></h2><p data-lake-id="98baa80381cc8e113ae6241cdafb0ccb" id="98baa80381cc8e113ae6241cdafb0ccb"><span data-lake-id="u7b9f30d0" id="u7b9f30d0" class="lake-fontsize-12">使用Linux命令查看配置的栈空间大小</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ulimit%20-s%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C7ic8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="J7LD7" id="J7LD7"><span data-lake-id="ua015f152" id="ua015f152">2.4 malloc和free</span></h2><p data-lake-id="b354e907b1bad2172bc9a6396e807ca6" id="b354e907b1bad2172bc9a6396e807ca6"><span data-lake-id="ud45cc564" id="ud45cc564" class="lake-fontsize-12">咱们经常提到malloc和free要搭配使用，但是我在写代码的时候经常忘记写free，程序运行起来也没有什么影响呀。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4077ebf7" id="u4077ebf7"><span data-lake-id="u1b837d23" id="u1b837d23" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">free()只能释放堆内存，并且只能释放整块堆内存，不能释放别的区段的内存或者释放一部分堆内存。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue6551056" id="ue6551056"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A4%2C%22id%22%3A%22QE3GQ%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e61e3ed" id="u7e61e3ed" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">：</span></p><ul list="u92029110"><li fid="u9e7be626" data-lake-id="u1cf71a2b" id="u1cf71a2b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u79da6cc1" id="u79da6cc1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">释放内存意味着将内存的使用权归还给系统。</span></li><li fid="u9e7be626" data-lake-id="u738c95bb" id="u738c95bb" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf37cdbd4" id="uf37cdbd4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">释放内存并不会改变指针的指向。（free后要将释放的指针指向空）</span></li><li fid="u9e7be626" data-lake-id="u89e9cdf6" id="u89e9cdf6" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4ae462e2" id="u4ae462e2" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">释放内存并不会对内存做任何修改，更不会将内存清零。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uffcbe318" id="uffcbe318"><br></p><p data-lake-id="7b5fdddbedaef16ceb36a563e1f1e1f2" id="7b5fdddbedaef16ceb36a563e1f1e1f2"><span data-lake-id="u8817c53c" id="u8817c53c" class="lake-fontsize-12">答：</span></p><p data-lake-id="c59c7ab18cbb71b7a026c3c5969947e9" id="c59c7ab18cbb71b7a026c3c5969947e9" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u67a11496" id="u67a11496" class="lake-fontsize-12">free() 函数的用处在于实时地回收内存，如果程序很简单，程序结束之前也不会使用过多的内存，不会降低系统 的性能。那么不写 free() 函数，当程序结束后，操作系统会释放内存。</span></p><p data-lake-id="46352ccb568a14c638b760f51650a198" id="46352ccb568a14c638b760f51650a198" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ufd714f76" id="ufd714f76" class="lake-fontsize-12">但是如果在开发大型程序时不写 free() 函数，后果是很严重的。这是因为很可能在程序中要重复一万次分配 10MB 的内存，如果每次进行分配内存后都使用 free() 函数去释放用完的内存空间， 那么这个程序只需要使用 10MB 内存就可以运行。但是如果不使用 free() 函数，那么程序就要使用 100GB 的内存！这其中包括绝大部分 的虚拟内存，而由于虚拟内存的操作需要读写磁盘，因此，这样会极大地影响到系统的性能，系统因此可能崩 溃。</span></p><p data-lake-id="267e27ddb5c09a923a24688c7400676a" id="267e27ddb5c09a923a24688c7400676a" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ue1adfa06" id="ue1adfa06" class="lake-fontsize-12">同时也要避免发生内存泄漏的操作：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*p%20%3D%20(char*)malloc(100%20*%20sizeof(char))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20p%20%3D%20(char*)malloc(50%20*%20sizeof(char))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20free(p)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20p%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XpVvn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="bfb7778cdae9aee0f9333cae15ff1bce" id="bfb7778cdae9aee0f9333cae15ff1bce" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ubb67c8b3" id="ubb67c8b3" class="lake-fontsize-12">该程序中，第一次分配 100 字节的内存，并将 p 指向它；第二次分配 50字节的内存，依然使用 p 指向它。这就导致了一个问题，第一次分配100 字节的内存没有指针指向它了，而且我们也不知道这块内存的址， 所以就再也无法找回了，也没法释放了，这块内存就成了垃圾内存，虽然毫无用处，但依然占用资源，唯一的 办法就是等程序运行结束后由操作系统回收。</span></p><p data-lake-id="9559df6e1ec73a10e2579e8935d31f69" id="9559df6e1ec73a10e2579e8935d31f69" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uc7847bf2" id="uc7847bf2" class="lake-fontsize-12">这就是内存泄露（ Memory Leak） ，可以理解为程序和内存失去了联系，再也无法对它进行任何操作。操作系统可提供给所有程序使用的内存空间正在被某个程序榨干，最终结果是程序 运行时间越长，占用内存空间越来越多，最终用尽全部内存空间，整个系统崩溃。</span></p><p data-lake-id="0cd853417723723f038ac775bd6f5542" id="0cd853417723723f038ac775bd6f5542"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560151218-a80d4703-1ec5-496a-a08b-2a871189bee8.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A197%2C%22height%22%3A201%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A440%2C%22originHeight%22%3A448%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c4bdb9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JWH1g%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="pl6iT" id="pl6iT"><span data-lake-id="ue3d7be4b" id="ue3d7be4b">2.5 字符串数组与字符串指针</span></h2><p data-lake-id="9e2b2224b877294f6cf586f4533ca82f" id="9e2b2224b877294f6cf586f4533ca82f"><span data-lake-id="u76808440" id="u76808440" class="lake-fontsize-12">我们可以用字符数组或者字符指针来保存字符串，那么这两个有什么区别呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id="260610fcf62f969d1abf9432cebcc482" id="260610fcf62f969d1abf9432cebcc482"><span data-lake-id="u79fefa8c" id="u79fefa8c" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="f3afb7accfde866b3953cdfade3e6365" id="f3afb7accfde866b3953cdfade3e6365"><span data-lake-id="u71f3554b" id="u71f3554b" class="lake-fontsize-12">答：这两者是有区别的，需要从内存角度来分析</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20str%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22hello%20world!%5C%5Cn%5C%22%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%22%2C%20str)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%5Cn%20for(i%3D0%3B%20i%3Clen%3B%20i%2B%2B)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%5C%22%2C%20str%5Bi%5D)%3B%5Cn%20%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22foCJt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="cb94934103540cc34afdea969344709c" id="cb94934103540cc34afdea969344709c"><span data-lake-id="u3c68179d" id="u3c68179d" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20*str%20%3D%20%5C%22hello%20world%5C%22%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cn%20printf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20str)%3B%5Cn%20%2F%2F%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8*(str%2Bi)%5Cn%20%20for(i%3D0%3B%20i%3Clen%3B%20i%2B%2B)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%5C%22%2C%20*(str%2Bi))%3B%5Cn%20%7D%5Cn%2F%2F%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8str%5Bi%5D%5Cnfor(i%3D0%3B%20i%3Clen%3B%20i%2B%2B)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%5C%22%2C%20str%5Bi%5D)%3B%5Cn%20%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tYPIP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="45ada27e34d79cf031e1a27a43bf60fc" id="45ada27e34d79cf031e1a27a43bf60fc"><span data-lake-id="u012e6e5e" id="u012e6e5e" class="lake-fontsize-12">这一切看起来和字符数组是多么地相似，它们都可以使用%s输出整个字符串，都可以使用*或[ ]获取单个字符</span></p><p data-lake-id="d97859504b3fd176e7c318fe4c62e017" id="d97859504b3fd176e7c318fe4c62e017"><span data-lake-id="ubb3ec6c6" id="ubb3ec6c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="bb56d13bad3d6543c70a2a49979bbd7c" id="bb56d13bad3d6543c70a2a49979bbd7c"><span data-lake-id="u4287eb94" id="u4287eb94" class="lake-fontsize-12">区别：根本的区别是在内存中的存储区域不一样，</span><span data-lake-id="u667dfdaa" id="u667dfdaa" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符数组存储在全局数据区或栈区</span><span data-lake-id="u24224b39" id="u24224b39" class="lake-fontsize-12">，</span><span data-lake-id="uaf96fa02" id="uaf96fa02" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符指针的字符串存储在常量区</span><span data-lake-id="uddc3e57e" id="uddc3e57e" class="lake-fontsize-12">。全局数据区和栈区的字符串有读取和写入的权限，而常量区的字符串只有读取权限，没有写入权限。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubda02795" id="ubda02795"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0---%E3%80%8B%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZXF0j%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="udc663300" id="udc663300" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1af25aa1" id="u1af25aa1"><span data-lake-id="u43492ac3" id="u43492ac3" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20main()%20%7B%20%5Cn%20char%20arr%5B%5D%3D%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Carr)%3B%5Cnarr%5B0%5D%3D'b'%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Carr)%3B%5Cn%5Cnchar%20*p%3D%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp)%3B%5Cn*p%3D'b'%3B%2F%2FSegmentation%20fault%20(core%20dumped)%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp)%3B%5Cn%7D%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iQqA2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="f029325a829bdb49b7901f564bcf2486" id="f029325a829bdb49b7901f564bcf2486"><span data-lake-id="u661d381a" id="u661d381a" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20s1%5B%5D%3D%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20s2%5B%5D%3D%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22s1%3A%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cs1)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22s2%3A%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cs2)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*%20p1%20%3D%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20p1%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF.rodata%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9Cabc%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*%20p2%20%3D%5C%22abc%5C%22%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20p2%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF.rodata%E4%B8%AD%E2%80%9Cabc%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22p1%3A%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp1)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22p2%3A%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp2)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dcony%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="d1c02e7a22fdd8e13132224d4ac97ade" id="d1c02e7a22fdd8e13132224d4ac97ade"><span data-lake-id="u3585db4a" id="u3585db4a" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20*%20%20str()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2Fchar%20*%20p%20%3D%5C%22hello%5C%22%3B%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20static%20char%20p%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22hello%5C%22%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%9A%8F%E7%9D%80%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0str%E5%87%BA%E6%A0%88%E8%80%8C%E6%B6%88%E4%BA%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%8Astatic%20%E5%88%99%E6%8A%8Ap%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%86.data%E9%87%8C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E9%9A%8F%E7%9D%80str%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%87%BA%E6%A0%88%E8%80%8C%E6%B6%88%E4%BA%A1%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20p%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnint%20main%20()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20*%20q%3DNULL%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20q%3Dstr()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cq)%3B%20%2F%2FSegmentation%20fault%20(core%20dumped)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sntr1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="3fffe0dbf7bafed4dbdf9fcdb2fa0f41" id="3fffe0dbf7bafed4dbdf9fcdb2fa0f41"><span data-lake-id="u1fb2075e" id="u1fb2075e" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="482e9df0821261525f71f5cd1ca19f6d" id="482e9df0821261525f71f5cd1ca19f6d" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uf5573fe9" id="uf5573fe9" class="lake-fontsize-12">在编程过程中如果只涉及到对字符串的读取，那么字符数组和字符串常量都能够满足要求；如果有写入（修改）操作，那么只能使用字符数组，不能使用字符串常量。</span></p>